# Optional DeepSeek fallback. Leave DEEPSEEK_API_KEY unset to stay on the local model.
# The gateway reads this file only. Do not commit it. Do not paste the key into chat.
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# Set to 1 to skip DeepSeek during weekday peak (01:00-04:00 and 06:00-10:00 UTC).
# Non-urgent jobs can wait with ./bin/offpeak.sh --wait.
# DEEPSEEK_OFF_PEAK_ONLY=1
